% backend: none
% expect-output: ab
% Scenario: SubFileDecode ends at its string. With a count of 0 the data
% ends at the first occurrence of the string, which is consumed but not
% passed.
% Expect: ab.
(ab*EOD*cd) << /EODString (*EOD*) /EODCount 0 >> /SubFileDecode filter
100 string readstring pop =
